stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoStock

    NoStock --> Available: PATCH .../stock (create)

    Available --> Reserved: POST .../reserve
    Reserved --> Sold: POST .../sold
    Reserved --> Available: POST .../return

    Available --> Deleted: DELETE
    Sold --> Deleted: DELETE
    Deleted --> [*]

    note left of Available
        PATCH .../stock also updates qty in place
        DELETE on Available only succeeds when there
        is no reservation or sales history
    end note

    note right of Reserved
        POST .../reserve requires qty > 0
        (atomic SELECT ... FOR UPDATE)
        DELETE is blocked with 409 while a
        reservation is active
    end note

    note right of Sold
        DELETE is blocked with 409 once a
        product has any sales history
    end note
